          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balam odwoko Balak ni, “Akiwaco ri jomikwenda perin m'ioro bongan ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "‘Makada nende Balak omiyan ot pere m'opoŋ feza gi zahabu, oyido akinyali foco dhok Rwoth, timo bero kosa raco i mito paran won. Gima Rwoth owaci, meno am'alawaco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo pama an adoki bongi ji paran. To weyi kutho amiyin rieko gima ji me jolatimo ri ji perin i hongo ma bino.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
